\f1\fs22 For two days, Chip Stockwell had been a grumpy bear in a cage, although he was fed well, straight from Eloise\'92s kitchen. If he was going to be locked up for telling truth to arms dealers, it might as well be in a cell with five-star catering.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

